"lang-hidden\">Select your role to see the full journey from first conversation to value realization.</span></p></div>\n  <div class=\"journey-roles\" id=\"journey-roles\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n  <div id=\"journey-contents\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<!-- INDUSTRIES -->\n<section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"industries\"><div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">行业专长</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Industries</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">深谙行业，才懂变革</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Deep Industry Knowledge Drives Real Change</span></h2></div>\n  <div class=\"grid-4\" id=\"industries-grid\">\n    <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"financial-services\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">金融服务</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Financial Services</span></div>\n    <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"retail-consumer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">零售与消费品</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Retail &amp; Consumer</span></div>\n    <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"healthcare\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">医疗健康</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Healthcare</span></div>\n    <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"manufacturing\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">先进制造</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Advanced Manufacturing</span></div>\n    <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"energy\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">能源与碳中和</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Energy &amp; Net Zero</span></div>\n    <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"tmt\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">科技媒体电信</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">TMT</span></div>\n    <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"public-sector\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">公共事业</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Public Sector</span></div>\n    <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"automotive\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">汽车与出行</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Automotive &amp; Mobility</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"industry-detail\" id=\"industry-detail-panel\">\n    <div class=\"industry-detail__header\"><h3 class=\"industry-detail__title\"></h3><button class=\"industry-detail__close\">&times;</button></div>\n    <div class=\"industry-detail__grid\">\n      <div><p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">核心痛点</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Key Pain Points</span></p><ul class=\"industry-detail__list industry-detail__pains\"></ul></div>\n      <div><p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">Evoing 方法</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Evoing Approach</span></p><p class=\"industry-detail__approach\"></p><div class=\"industry-detail__caps\"></div></div>\n      <div style=\"grid-column:1/-1;\"><p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">预期成果</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Expected Outcomes</span></p><ul class=\"industry-detail__list industry-detail__outcomes\"></ul></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<!-- PARTNER ECOSYSTEM -->\n<section class=\"secti