odernize code assets, and design future-ready operating models in the AI era.</span></p>\n    <div class=\\\"hero__actions\\\">\n      <a href=\\\"#solutions\\\" class=\\\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">了解解决方案</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Explore Solutions</span></a>\n      <a href=\\\"#contact\\\" class=\\\"btn btn--outline-inverse btn--lg\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">联系我们</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Get in Touch</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n</section>\n\n<\"'!-- STATS -->\n<section class=\"section--alt\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"stats-banner\">\n  <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-item__value\">500+</div><div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球顾问</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Consultants</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-item__value\">14</div><div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球办公室</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Offices</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-item__value\">200+</div><div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">企业客户</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Enterprise Clients</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-item__value\">8</div><div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">行业覆盖</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Industry Verticals</span></div></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<!-- CAPABILITIES -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"capabilities\"><div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">核心能力</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Capabilities</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">智能驱动，代码落地</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Intelligence-Driven, Code-Proven</span></h2></div>\n  <div class=\"filter-bar\" data-filter-target=\".card\">\n    <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"ai-strategy\">AI</button><button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"code-modernization\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"operating-model\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ops</span></button><button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"data-intelligence\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"cyber-resilience\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">安全</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Security</span></button><button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"strategy-advisory\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy</span></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid-3\">\n    <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"ai-strategy\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F9E0;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 战略与转型</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Strategy &amp; Transformation</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">从战略规划到落地执行，帮助企业构建 AI 原生竞争力。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">From strategic planning to execution, we help enterprises build AI-native competitiveness.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 成熟度评估</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Maturity Assessment</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">生成式 AI 落地</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Generative AI Implementation</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 治理与合规</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Governance &amp; Compliance</span></span></div></article>\n    <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"code-modernization\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x2328;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码现代化</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code Modernization</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">通过平台工程、架构演进和遗留系统改造，释放软件资产的长期价值。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Unlock the long-term value of software assets through platform engineering, architecture evolution, and legacy modernization.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">平台工程</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Platform Engineering</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">遗留系统迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Legacy System Migration</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">云原生架构</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cloud-Native Architecture</span></span></div></article>\n    <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"operating-model\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x2699;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营模式设计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Operating Model Design</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">重塑组织架构、流程与人才体系，使技术真正驱动业务增长。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Reshape organizational structure, processes, and talent systems so technology genuinely drives business growth.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">技术组织设计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Technology Org Design</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">敏捷与产品运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Agile &amp; Product Operations</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">变革管理</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Change Management</span></span></div></article>\n    <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"data-intelligence\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F4CA;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据智能</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Intelligence</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">打通数据孤岛，构建可扩展的数据平台与智能决策体系。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Break down data silos, build scalable data platforms and intelligent decision-making systems.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Strategy</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据平台架构</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Platform Architecture</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据治理</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Governance</span></span></div></article>\n    <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"cyber-resilience\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F6E1;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">网络韧性</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cyber Resilience</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">在日益复杂的威胁环境中，构建从预防到恢复的全周期安全能力。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Build full-cycle security capabilities from prevention to recovery.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">零信任架构</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Zero Trust Architecture</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">事件响应</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Incident Response</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">合规与审计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Compliance &amp; Audit</span></span></div></article>\n    <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"strategy-advisory\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F9ED;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略咨询</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy Advisory</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">结合行业洞察与技术视野，为企业制定可执行的数字化增长战略。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Combine industry insight with technology vision to craft executable digital growth strategies.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数字化战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Digital Strategy</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">技术尽职调查</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Technology Due Diligence</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">并购整合</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">M&amp;A Integration</span></span></div></article>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<!-- TRUST & GOVERNANCE -->\n<section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"trust\"><div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">信任与治理</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Trust &amp; Governance</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">我们如何建立并守护客户信任</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">How We Build and Protect Client Trust</span></h2></div>\n  <div class=\"trust-grid\" id=\"trust-grid\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n  <div class=\"certifications-bar\" id=\"certs-bar\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<!-- SOLUTIONS -->\n<section class=\"section section--dark\" id=\"solutions\"><div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">解决方案</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Solutions</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">跨能力整合，端到端交付</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cross-Capability, End-to-End Delivery</span></h2><p class=\"section-header__desc\" style=\"color:var(--color-slate-300);\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">点击卡片查看详情。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Click a card for details.</span></p></div>\n  <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--solutions\">\n    <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"ai-strategy\">AI</button><button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"code-modernization\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"data-intelligence\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data</span></button><button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"cyber-resilience\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">安全</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Security</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"operating-model\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ops</span></button><button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"strategy-advisory\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy</span></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"solutions-grid\" id=\"solutions-grid\"></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<div class=\"solution-drawer__backdrop\" id=\"solution-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<div class=\"solution-drawer\" id=\"solution-drawer\">\n  <button class=\"solution-drawer__close\">&times;</button>\n  <h2 class=\"solution-drawer__title\"></h2>\n  <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\"><p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">业务挑战</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Challenge</span></p><p class=\"solution-drawer__text solution-drawer__problem\"></p></div>\n  <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\"><p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">方法</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Approach</span></p><p class=\"solution-drawer__text solution-drawer__approach\"></p></div>\n  <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\"><p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">模块</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Modules</span></p><div class=\"solution-drawer__modules\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--space-xs);\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\"><p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">成果</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Outcomes</span></p><p class=\"solution-drawer__text solution-drawer__outcomes\"></p></div>\n  <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\"><p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">指标</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Metrics</span></p><ul class=\"solution-drawer__metrics-list\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;\"></ul></div>\n  <div class=\"solution-drawer__related\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SERVICES -->\n<section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">服务产品</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Offerings</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">每个能力，具体到交付物与时间线</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Every Capability, Defined to Deliverables &amp; Timeline</span></h2></div>\n  <div class=\"grid-3\" id=\"service-grid\"></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<!-- METHODOLOGY -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"methodology\"><div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">方法论</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Methodology</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">六步闭环，从诊断到价值实现</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Six Steps from Diagnosis to Value Realization</span></h2></div>\n  <div class=\"methodology-timeline\" id=\"methodology-timeline\">\n    <div class=\"methodology-step methodology-step--active\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">1</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 1</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">诊断</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Diagnose</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">通过定量评估与利益相关方访谈，精准定位技术债务与 AI 就绪度差距。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Pinpoint technical debt and AI readiness gaps through quantitative assessment.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">现状评估</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Assessment</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">2–4 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">2–4 wks</span></p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">2</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 2</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategize</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">将诊断洞察转化为可执行路线图，明确投资优先级。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Translate insights into an executable roadmap with clear priorities.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">路线图</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Roadmap</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">3–6 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">3–6 wks</span></p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">3</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 3</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">原型</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Prototype</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">以最小可行产品验证关键假设与业务价值。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Validate key assumptions and business value with MVPs.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">概念验证</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">POC</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">4–8 wks</span></p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">4</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 4</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">工程交付</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Engineer</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">以平台工程实践规模化交付生产级系统。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Deliver production-grade systems at scale.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">生产平台</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Prod Platform</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">8–16 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">8–16 wks</span></p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">5</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 5</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Migrate</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">通过结构化交接确保客户团队自主运营。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ensure client teams can independently operate.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">交接计划</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Handover</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">4–8 wks</span></p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">6</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 6</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">价值实现</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Realize</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">持续跟踪 KPI 确保投资回报。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Track KPIs to ensure ROI.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">价值仪表板</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Dashboard</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">持续</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ongoing</span></p></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"methodology-principles\">\n    <div class=\"methodology-principle\"><p class=\"methodology-principle__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码即战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code is Strategy</span></p><p class=\"methodology-principle__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">软件架构决策本身就是商业战略决策。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Software architecture decisions are inherently business strategy decisions.</span></p></div>\n    <div class=\"methodology-principle\"><p class=\"methodology-principle__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">客户能力内建</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Build Client Capability</span></p><p class=\"methodology-principle__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">衡量标准是客户能否独立前行。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">The measure is whether the client can move forward independently.</span></p></div>\n    <div class=\"methodology-principle\"><p class=\"methodology-principle__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">指标驱动决策</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Metrics-Driven</span></p><p class=\"methodology-principle__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">每个阶段都由可量化指标驱动。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Every phase is driven by quantifiable metrics.</span></p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<!-- CASE STUDIES -->\n<section class=\"section section--dark\" id=\"case-studies\"><div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">案例研究</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Case Studies</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">交付成果，而非报告</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">We Deliver Outcomes, Not Decks</span></h2><p class=\"section-header__desc\" style=\"color:var(--color-slate-300);\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">点击查看完整故事。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Click for the full story.</span></p></div>\n  <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--case-ind\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-md);\">\n    <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部行业</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"financial-services\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">金融</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Financial</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"retail-consumer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">零售</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Retail</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"healthcare\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">医疗</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Healthcare</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"manufacturing\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">制造</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Manufacturing</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"energy\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">能源</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Energy</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"tmt\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">TMT</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"public-sector\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">公共</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Public</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"automotive\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">汽车</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Auto</span></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--case-region\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-2xl);\">\n    <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部地区</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"apac\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">亚太</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">APAC</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"emea\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">EMEA</span></button>\n    <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"amer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">美洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Americas</span></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"case-studies-grid\" id=\"case-studies-grid\"></div>\n  <div class=\"case-study-detail\" id=\"case-study-detail\">\n    <div class=\"case-study-detail__header\"><h3 class=\"case-study-detail__title\"></h3><button class=\"case-study-detail__close\">&times;</button></div>\n    <div class=\"case-study-detail__grid\">\n      <div><p class=\"case-study-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">挑战</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Challenge</span></p><p class=\"case-study-detail__text case-study-detail__challenge\"></p></div>\n      <div><p clas