< {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"f325c118-0a06-46f2-9a2f-bd7adacd7166","text":"## Round 4 Complete — Trust, Journeys, Resources, Partners, Brand Assets\n\n**Validation:** 189/189 checks passed, zero failures.\n\n**First-party lines:** 5,982 (up from 5,783). Files: 60 (up from 45). Gap to 10,000: 4,018 lines.\n\n### New Files (15 added)\n\n| File | Lines | Content |\n|---|---|---|\n| `src/data/trust.json` | 46 | 4 pillars (Responsible AI, Security, Privacy, Compliance) with frameworks + commitments; 6 certifications |\n| `src/data/client-journeys.json` | 74 | 6 C-suite roles (CEO/CTO/CIO/COO/CFO/CHRO), each with 4 pain points, 4-step journey, success metrics |\n| `src/data/resources.json` | 122 | 12 resources across whitepaper/playbook/briefing/webinar/assessment formats, filterable by industry |\n| `src/data/partners.json` | 48 | 4 categories (Cloud, Data&AI, Security, Infra), 13 named partners with tier + competencies, 3 collaboration models |\n| `src/data/brand-assets.json` | 37 | 4 brand principles, color palette (4 swatches), typography system (3 families), 6 presentation modules, 4 downloadable assets |\n| `src/css/trust.css` | 22 | 2-col pillar cards with framework tags + commitment checklist; certification badge bar |\n| `src/css/journeys.css` | 32 | Role selector tabs, pain/journey 2-col layout, 4-step cards, success metrics banner |\n| `src/css/resources.css` | 29 | Dual filter bar, resource cards with format badges, request-access state |\n| `src/css/partners.css` | 24 | 2-col category grid, partner cards with tier + competency tags, 3-col collaboration models |\n| `src/css/brand-assets.css` | 48 | 4-col principles, color swatches with hex + usage, type samples, presentation module grid, download cards |\n| `src/js/trust.js` | 4 | Placeholder (content rendered in main.js) |\n| `src/js/journeys.js` | 21 | Role tab selector — toggles journey-content panels |\n| `src/js/resources.js` | 68 | Dual filter (format + industry) + request-access click state with toast |\n| `src/js/partners.js` | 3 | Placeholder |\n| `src/js/brand-assets.js` | 21 | Download button state toggle with toast |\n\n### New Interactions\n\n- **Trust & Governance** — 4 pillar cards showing frameworks (tag chips) and commitments (checkbox list); 6 certification badges\n- **Client Journeys** — 6 role tabs (CEO → CHRO); each shows pain points, 4-step journey cards, and success metrics\n- **Resource Library** — dual filter (format: whitepaper/playbook/briefing/webinar/assessment × industry); click \"Request Access\" toggles to \"Requested\" with toast\n- **Partner Ecosystem** — 4 category grids with 13 named partners showing tier and competency tags; 3 collaboration models\n- **Brand & Media Kit** — 4 brand principles, color swatches with hex/usage, typography specimens in actual fonts, 6-slide-count presentation modules, 4 simulated download cards\n\n### Start & Validate\n\n```\nnpm start       → http://0.0.0.0:5173\nnpm test        → 189 checks, 60 files, 20 data files, 17 CSS, 17 JS\n```\n\n### Next Round Gaps\n\n- At 5,982 lines, need ~4,000 more. The most efficient path is dedicated detail pages rather than more index.html sections\n- Individual article detail pages (12 × ~100 lines each)\n- Case study full-page narratives (8 × ~150 lines)\n- Office detail pages with local team and case studies (14 × ~80 lines)\n- Privacy Policy and Terms of Use actual content (~200 lines each)\n- `sitemap.xml` and `robots.txt`\n- PWA manifest and service worker\n- The old `src/data/cases.json` (3 lightweight entries) is now superseded by `case-studies.json` and could be removed to reduce confusion","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e3039-8d5f-7b51-9f13-ea9f656a3bbf","completedAtMs":1778926905255}}
